{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/goingtoproduction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What a wallet needs before real holders use it."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","generated":true,"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A wallet holding real credentials is only as trustworthy as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"platform it runs on. The package enforces some of this itself: without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/development","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", receiving credentials needs a key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store and a credential store that both say they’re durable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore\/isDurable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore\/isDurable","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), and services on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loopback addresses are refused. The rest is the app’s.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Keys and storage","anchor":"Keys-and-storage"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":"’s defaults: keys in the Secure Enclave,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"persistent, and holder keys asking for Face ID, Touch ID or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"passcode before each presentation. Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Info.plist."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":": complete data protection, out of backups."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" is for tests."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/sweepOrphanedKeys(in:)"},{"type":"text","text":" at launch, before any issuance,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so keys an interrupted issuance left don’t accumulate."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make one "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" per key store and credential store, and share it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the app’s life. Two over the same stores don’t coordinate: both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could present the same copy of a credential, so Verifiers could link"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentations, or redeem the same refresh token, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authorization server revokes the grant."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A device restored from a backup has no holder keys: its credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/holderKeyPresent"},{"type":"text","text":" as false and can’t be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented. Delete them, and receive them again."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"The Wallet Provider","anchor":"The-Wallet-Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers trust the wallet because its Wallet Provider attests it. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"production Wallet Provider should attest a wallet and its keys only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after checking App Attest evidence that it’s talking to your genuine","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app on a genuine device, and should keep its own signing key in an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"HSM. The demo wallet’s provider attests anything, and is for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"development only.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Trust","anchor":"Trust"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","t